{
  "node_id": "concept:mixture",
  "title": "混合物",
  "pattern_refs": ["pattern:concept-core"],
  "summary": "由两种或两种以上的物质混合而成的物质叫做混合物。空气是典型的混合物。",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "definition",
      "title": "定义",
      "content": [
        "像空气这样由两种或两种以上的物质混合而成的物质叫做混合物。"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:air-composition-3"]
    },
    {
      "id": "essence",
      "title": "本质理解",
      "content": [
        "混合物是由多种物质混合而成，各组分保持各自的性质，没有发生化学反应形成新物质。"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:air-composition-3"]
    },
    {
      "id": "key-points",
      "title": "核心要点",
      "content": [
        "混合物由两种或两种以上物质组成",
        "各组分保持原有性质",
        "空气是典型的混合物"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:air-composition-3"]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "典型例子",
      "content": [
        "空气：由氮气、氧气、稀有气体、二氧化碳等混合而成"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:air-composition-3"]
    }
  ],
  "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:air-composition-3"],
